to the mid-credits scene we go to the  eternals the ship the domo and we see  makari athena and druid and thena and  makari pick up on a presence that is  coming onto the ship they brace  themselves for an enemy but all of a  sudden a character teleports onto the  ship this is pip the troll pip the troll  comes from the planet laxadasia now  originally he didn't look like a troll  until one night he partied with some  trolls and he drank a liquor and he  turned into one he was then exiled from  his planet and eventually he teamed up  with adam warlock now it's recently been  announced that adam warlock will make  his mcu debut in guardians of the galaxy  vol 3 being played by will poulter  however pip is not with adam warlock in  the post-credits scene fina is about to  ask who pip is but pip interrupts  because he's about to announce who is  coming pip says behold the royal prince  of titan brother of thanos the knave of  hearts he then says the defeater of  black robert but quickly corrects it to  black roger the great adventurer star  fox now when star fox comes in he says  hello my fellow eternals thenos asks who  he is and he says i am aeros druid then  asks what he wants and then eros pulls  out the prime orb the same type of orb  that ajax and then cersei had which was  used to communicate with irishum aeros  then looks at the orb and says your  friends are in trouble and we know where  to find them okay so let's break this  down eros aka star fox is an eternal  this is why he says hello my fellow  eternals he is an eternal in the comics  and his brother is indeed thanos now  some people may be asking how that's  possible thanos doesn't look anything  like an eternal well in the comics  thanos is indeed an eternal he was born  of two eternal parents alars and sui-san  so thanos was born an eternal but he  inherited the deviant gene which is why  he looks oh purple and all messed up now  aeros parents are also thanos's parents  aeros is thanos's younger brother in the  comics the father alars established an  eternal settlement on titan you may  remember titan from avengers infinity  war thanos said that it was his home we  won't dive too deep into this in this  video i'll save it for another one let's  keep this video simple when arrow says  his friends are in trouble it's  obviously because eresham has taken them  now eros does have a prime orb since  alars his father was the one to  establish a settlement on titan we could  assume that his father had the prime orb  and communicated with a celestial  however it does seem like arrows and  perhaps a few other eternals found out  what the celestials were doing and much  like the eternals that we just watched  they decided to not go with what the  celestials wanted it looks like aeros  managed to flee and not get captured by  a celestial and is now trying to recruit  other eternals to go and save some of  his fellow eternals as well now the  question is where did arishem take the  other eternals they actually mentioned  this in the movie airshim is explaining  to serzei how the eternals were created  and he says that their home where they  were created is called the world forge  so this is going to be where they're  going to be heading down the line in the  mcu now one thing to take note of is  that pip the troll called arrows the  knave of heart and this is because his  power is literally the ability to get  women to fall in love with him aeros has  dated a lot of people in the marvel  universe including she-hulk and since  she-hulk is coming up i'm wondering if  there will be any type of connection  there but we'll have to wait and see on  that now i wouldn't be surprised if  marvel toned him down a lot in the mcu  and perhaps gave him different powers  but again we'll have to wait and see now  aeros and thanos never really got along  in the comics although we don't see much  interaction between them however arrows  does at one point become an avenger and  fight alongside them now for the post  credit scene in the film we're  introduced to dane whitman and he talks  about his family and how the history of  his family is very complicated that is  because he is actually the character or  will go on to be the character the black  knight now the first black knight  started with one of dane whitman's  ancestors sir percy of scandia the first  black knight he was eventually murdered  and it was passed down to another percy  descendant until eventually it got down  to dane whitman's uncle nathan garrett  now when he became the black knight he  decided that he was going to be a  villain now he would go on to be  mortally wounded in a fight against iron  man he fled and he called his nephew  dane whitman to his side he told him  everything and asked him to atone for  the mistakes that he made and return the  honor of their family legacy as the  black knight being a hero now this is  probably what dane whitman was referring  to when he was telling cersei that his  family history is complicated and this  takes us to the post-credits scene dane  is in an office presumably his and he's  debating on whether or not to open a  crate and take a sword that is inside of  it his family crest is on top of the  chest and you can tell that dane is  super nervous he opens it really quickly  and steps back because he starts to hear  a lot of voices you can't really make  them out but you can tell that something  is up with the sword on the top of the  chest when he opens it is markings that  say death is my reward dane says i'm  sorry but i have to try saying sorry  most likely to his ancestors that came  before him because as we know the mcu  doesn't keep origin stories as they are  in the comics more on this in a second  dane reaches towards the sword and part  of the sword is showing not wrapped up  and it appears that the sword is  somewhat alive having some black stuff  on it that reaches out towards dane as  he goes to touch it now right before he  touches it he hears a voice from behind  him that says are you sure you're ready  for that mr whitman now this voice has  been confirmed originally i did think it  was a watcher and a lot of people are  saying it is the watcher however the  director came out and said that it is  blade it is the voice of mahershala ali  who is going to be playing blade so it  looks like the eternals post credit  scene just confirmed that the black  knight and blade will be teaming up in  the mcu at some point in time and again  this was confirmed to be blade's voice  by the director chloe saw in an  interview with fandom now what this  post-credit scene is doing is setting up  dane whitman to become the black knight  in the mcu and this sword that he's  about to touch is the ebony blade  however there's a little bit of a trick  to the ebony blade the blade was a  magical blade forged by the wizard  merlin and dane whitman's ancestor sir  percy it was formed from the starstone  meteorite the blade is enchanted to cut  through any object it can prevent death  of its wielder and it can deflect any  type of magic however it was also  revealed to be cursed null the symbiote  god revealed the true nature of the  ebony blade the curse was that it would  slowly corrupt any user and cause a lust  for violence bloodshed and death  according to knoll it can only be  wielded by the impure of heart drawing  out their negative emotions until they  become bloodthirsty berserkers so yes  it's enchanted and can cut through  anything and deflect magic but it comes  at a pretty high cost now dane most  likely knows something about this which  is why he's so nervous to even open the  chest but this also means that he  probably knows that once he grabs it he  will become the black knight but like i  mentioned there is a pretty big curse  that comes with it which is why blade  shows up and says are you sure you want  to do that and those are the two  eternals post credits scene if you  enjoyed the eternals 